  "ingredients": [
    "1 yellow onion, diced",
    "4 thick slices cherrywood-smoked bacon, cut into 1-inch pieces",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "2.5 pounds Yukon Gold potatoes, peeled and chopped",
    "1 cup water",
    "1.5 teaspoons garlic base (such as Better Than Bouillon® Roasted Garlic Base)",
    "1.5 cups half-and-half",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "0.25 cup sliced green onions",
    "ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Turn on a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot) and select Sauté function. Add onion, bacon, and butter to the hot Pot; cook until bacon is crispy, 5 to 8 minutes. Turn off Sauté function; transfer onion mixture to a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1haK0sNJB0FxxgoKcSSP92MH-p4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276654-instant-pot-loaded-baked-potato-soup-VAT-step-01-764a73f2ec664a46a52798a3cfdaf973.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276654/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add potatoes, water, and garlic base to the Pot. Close and lock the lid. Select high pressure according to manufacturer's instructions; set timer for 12 minutes. Allow 10 to 15 minutes for pressure to build.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lF2rrbnF_2vvXjA0J5Yxdvv9xWA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276654-instant-pot-loaded-baked-potato-soup-VAT-step-02-3f4f37f2e9424f84aadd28e521e55e56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276654/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Release pressure using the natural-release method according to manufacturer's instructions, about 15 minutes. Release remaining pressure carefully using the quick-release method, about 5 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid. Mash potatoes against the side of the Pot, leaving some chunks if desired. Stir in onion-bacon mixture and half-and-half to combine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dFZC2OqKPdbbCCjdZEzrPkvVIgY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/276654-instant-pot-loaded-baked-potato-soup-VAT-step-03-f6219aeab6384e38857ea7263c0419d6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/276654/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide soup among bowls; top with green onions, Cheddar cheese, and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
